Modifications: translated selected Python algorithm and candidate-tree behavior
to TypeScript, integrated with native DSH managed children, Cordis configuration,
policy enforcement, structured output, storage and explicit lesson approval.
The upstream Python CLI, benchmark runners and dependencies are not bundled.
Original DSH contributions retain the repository MIT license.
See LICENSE for both license texts and their scope.

Source mapping:
  harness2/core/recursion.py -> src/schedule.ts
  harness2/core/tree.py -> src/candidate.ts
